                                                "text": "He met Luis Suarez's cross at the far post, only for Chelsea keeper Petr Cech to show brilliant reflexes to deflect his header on to the bar. Carroll turned away to lead Liverpool's insistent protests that the ball had crossed the line but referee Phil Dowd and assistant referee Andrew Garratt waved play on, with even a succession of replays proving inconclusive."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "25809cfa-e687-3049-8378-1862da06d6e7",
                                        "entry_id": "0a8f0fa5-7c6a-33bf-99ce-74c4187fc8ff",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To refuse to admit someone or accept something."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "972f7c29-7e4b-4b5c-a457-f44dbd0b7fd6",
                                                "sense_id": "25809cfa-e687-3049-8378-1862da06d6e7",
                                                "text": "He was turned away at the border because he didn't have a valid visa."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2e6eac88-deb4-4e37-b5b9-d79be18b7f30",
                                                "sense_id": "25809cfa-e687-3049-8378-1862da06d6e7",
                                                "text": "The referee turned away the players' protests."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "11ecc581-4d37-4269-b4bf-176326c1d7e3",
                                                "sense_id": "25809cfa-e687-3049-8378-1862da06d6e7",
                                                "text": "For heauen doth know (ſo ſhall the world perceiue)\nThat I haue turn'd away my former Selfe,\nSo will I thoſe that kept me Companie."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "31af1136-081b-3bd8-a9ef-b34061c0215c",
                                        "entry_id": "0a8f0fa5-7c6a-33bf-99ce-74c4187fc8ff",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To avert or ward off the occurrence or effects of."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "193d1c50-c8e8-42d2-a037-edcc54e6cff5",
                                                "sense_id": "31af1136-081b-3bd8-a9ef-b34061c0215c",
                                                "text": "to turn away disaster"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7f624695-1068-3142-81b5-4f8005d4e8d8",
                                        "entry_id": "0a8f0fa5-7c6a-33bf-99ce-74c4187fc8ff",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To dismiss from service."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "327551fc-ef69-47a8-b9e6-489eea21d483",
                                                "sense_id": "7f624695-1068-3142-81b5-4f8005d4e8d8",
                                                "text": "to turn away a servant"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5c6682cc-1aaa-30a5-bac3-04d0eec4a757",
                                        "entry_id": "0a8f0fa5-7c6a-33bf-99ce-74c4187fc8ff",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To forsake or refuse an association or commitment."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively",
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d3d6f689-7c35-479c-8803-cc3f51db0026",
                                                "sense_id": "5c6682cc-1aaa-30a5-bac3-04d0eec4a757",
                                                "text": "He turned away from his old comrades."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a7120734-53a9-4cfa-8455-5a20411428d2",
                                                "sense_id": "5c6682cc-1aaa-30a5-bac3-04d0eec4a757",
                                                "text": "She increasingly turned away from politics."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0f6e6deb-94a1-4c40-a979-5f61a802be92",
                                                "sense_id": "5c6682cc-1aaa-30a5-bac3-04d0eec4a757",
                                                "text": "Some people donate what they can, while others simply turn away."
                                            }
